  "actual_changes": [
    "Finite filesystem-only history consumer and genuine source-set/coverage binding factory now call the original adoption commit. Inspection holds both original locks; the shortest native lifetime includes Redis opaque hold expiry.",
    "Formal page Redis writer and dedicated source-recovery leaf use original ACL custody, actual Pod/container/PVC identity and same-process private native handles. Recovery cannot reopen a fenced ACL as its original state.",
    "Original observer PKI CLI validates original installer authority and actual Kubernetes identities, issues distinct client/node mTLS leaves, and writes private create-only files. Production material issuance has not run on site.",
    "Both native whole-node and gateway-node server CLI sources are included. Dockerfile and offline builder resolve all four required observer tools among 46 installed commands."
  ],
